msgid ""
"The goal is not perfection—it’s expression, exploration, and extending the "
"life of your timber. Whether you're turning an old pallet into a plant "
"stand, a drawer into a floating shelf, or simply restoring a worn-out side "
"table, you’ll leave with a reimagined wooden piece you can actually."
msgstr ""

